// ---- Order Replaced Message: 84 bytes ----------------------------------------

// This message acknowledges the receipt and acceptance of a valid Replace Order Message. Like Order Accepted Message, Order Replaced Message always comes before any Order Executed Messages or Order Cancelled Messages for the replacement.
